2. PROJECT STRUCTURE

/Root_Directory

- main.py       # System entry point and main login loop
- README        # Project information

- database      # Data layer
-- connection.py            # Encapsulated MySQL connection logic
-- schema.sql               # 3NF table definitions and constraints
-- stored_procedures.sql    # CRUD and analytical logic
---- viewing_sp.sql     # Viewing logic
---- finding_sp.sql     # Finding logic
---- adding_sp.sql      # Adding logic
---- updating_sp.sql    # Updating logic
---- deleting_sp.sql    # Deleting logic
---- utilities_sp.sql   # Additional procedures


- menus         # Interaction layer
-- shared_menu_options.py  # Reusable menu actions
-- student.py              # Student portal
-- teacher.py              # Teacher portal
-- admin                   # Admin portal
---- admin.py            # Admin portal
---- admin_menu.py       # Admin management menu
---- courses_menu.py     # Courses management menu
---- reporting_menu.py   # Reports menu
---- rooms_menu.py       # Rooms management menu (Rooms, Room Types)
---- student_submenu.py  # Students management menu (Student,
                                     Registration, Grades, Attendance)
---- teacher_submenu.py  # Teachers management menu
                                     (Teacher, Teaching, Schedule)


- models        # OOP models
-- admin.py             # Admin specific attributes
                                           (Inheritance from person.py)
-- attendance.py        # Attendance specific attributes
-- authentication.py    # Login credentials and role
-- course.py            # Course specific attributes
-- grades.py            # Grades specific attributes
-- person.py            # Base people class (Inheritance, Abstraction)
-- registration.py      # Students' registration specific attributes
-- room.py              # Rooms specific attributes
-- schedule.py          # Schedule specific attributes
-- student.py           # Student specific attributes
                                           (Inheritance from person.py)
-- teacher.py           # Teacher specific attributes
                                           (Inheritance from person.py)
-- teaching.py          # Teacher-to-Course combination


- services      # Database-to-Python logic via stored procedures
-- admin_services.py             # Admin management [view, add]
-- attendance_services.py        # Attendance management [view, add]
-- auth_services.py              # Login and authentication logic
                                                              [update]
-- course_services.py            # Course management [full CRUD]
-- grade_services.py             # Grades management
                                                   [view, add, update]
-- registration_services.py      # Registration management [full CRUD]
-- room_services.py              # Rooms management [view, add]
-- schedule_services.py          # Schedule management [view, add]
-- student_services.py           # Student management [full CRUD]
-- teacher_services.py           # Teacher management [full CRUD]
-- teaching_services.py          # Teaching management [full CRUD]


- utilities     # Shared utilities
-- decorators.py            # Transaction and sorting decorators
-- displaying.py            # Tabulate-based tables display
-- input_validation.py      # Regex and type input check
-- menu_options.py          # Dynamic menu printing
-- reporting.py             # Reporting via stored procedures
-- searching.py             # Binary Search Algorithm implementation
-- sorting.py               # Merge Sort Algorithm implementation

=======================================================================

3. INSTALLATION AND CONFIGURATION

Prerequisites:
- Python 3.10 or higher.
- MySQL Server 8.0+.
- Libraries: pip install mysql-connector-python tabulate

Database Setup:
1.  Execute 'database/schema.sql' in MySQL Workbench to create tables.
2.  Execute 'database/stored_procedures.sql' to initialize logic.

Configuration:
- Open 'database/connection.py' and update the __user and __password
attributes to match your local MySQL server credentials.

